# tidy-heavy: the saved game the tooheavy session (DOS's golden) and the tidy-objects enhanced
# session start from. A new character, as the newgame session makes one (every default, the
# name avatar); then a test's cheats (EXHUME_TEST_CHEATS=1; recording format 6): strength 10,
# so the player can carry 200 (20 stones), 200 coins (0xA0, a tenth of a stone each) into the
# pack, which is all the player can carry, and a stack of 20 coins at the player's feet. Saved
# in slot I, described "heavy". Taking one coin of the 20 is then too heavy (issue 9)
9000 key esc
12000 key esc
15000 key enter        # Create Character
18000 key enter        # every default: sex, handedness, class, the skills, the portrait,
20000 key enter        # the difficulty
22000 key enter
24000 key enter
26000 key enter
28000 key enter
30000 key enter
32000 key enter
34000 key a            # the name
34200 key v
34400 key a
34600 key t
34800 key a
35000 key r
36000 key enter
38000 key enter        # Yes
44000 cheat set str 10
44100 cheat give 0xA0 200
44200 cheat give 0xA0 20 drop
47000 down ctrl        # save: Ctrl+S, slot I, "heavy"
47100 key s
47300 up ctrl
49000 key enter
50500 key h
50700 key e
50900 key a
51100 key v
51300 key y
52000 key enter
